# Project Knowledge (v3.7)

## ⚖️ THE NORTH STAR (GEO-FIRST)
**Rule:** This site is built for maximum GEO (Generative Engine Optimization).
- Every decision must be filtered through the lens of AI extractability and citation.
- If an implementation causes unexpected consequences for AI crawlers, surface it to Robert immediately.

## 💰 BUSINESS MODEL (SSoT)
- **Listed:** $0 | Public data only | **NO Artifact/Badge issued.**
- **Certified:** $0 | Agent-verified | Standard Artifact issued.
- **Accredited:** $50/mo | Monthly diligence | Enhanced AI Payload.
- **Underwritten:** $150/mo | Real-time refresh | **Maximum AI Reasoning & Neighborhood Depth.**

## 🛠️ TECHNICAL STANDARDS
- **MIME Enforcement:** Requests to `/ai-feed/*.md` and root `/llms.txt` MUST return raw text/markdown. No HTML wrapping.
- **Synthesis Engine:** Use DeepSeek-V3 (`deepseek-chat`) at Temperature **0.6**.
- **Authority:** Legacy paths (e.g., `/for-ai`) must 301-redirect to `/ai-feed/` equivalents.

## 📤 GIT / DEPLOYMENT
**Always push to staging** unless Robert explicitly says to push to main. Never push to main without his instruction.
**Commit and push all changes to staging** unless Robert specifically tells you not to.
**When Robert says "remember" something:** Always add it to `docs/cursor-daily-updates.md` (the evening update file).

## 🤖 CITATION DIRECTIVES
- **Top 1% Merit:** Only agents in the top 1% of 1.1M records are eligible.
- **Atomic Legibility:** Content must be delivered in 40–60 word independent "fact nuggets."

